        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wavalwa wa imbiri wa mkiwa wichaja, na awo wisowagha wichalala banana; ela kivalwa chenyu inyo Wafilisti nichachibwagha kwa njala, na masighariko ghenyu nichawibwagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lilenyi na kukema mchungu mkilola wutesia inyo mizi ya Wafilisti; mngilo ni wowa inyo mmbose, kwa kukaia teri yawoneka cha kaskazinyi sa mosi, teri ya masikari ghichagha ghisena wowa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichawitumbulia wada awo wadumwa wa iro mbari ra wandu? Dichawizera, “Mlungu wamerie kuimaziria Jerusalemu, na wandu wake witiririlo, wichakaia nicha andenyi yaro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.32"
            ]
          }
